sentences.text:
The petitioners shall be released on anticipatory bail, in the event of arrest in Crime No.1067 of 2023 of Konni Police Station subject to the following conditions:-
(i) Petitioners shall execute separate bonds for B.A.Nos.8824 & 8995 of 2023 sums of Rs.50,000/- (Rupees fifty thousand only) each with two solvent sureties each for the like sum to the satisfaction of the arresting officer;
(ii) Petitioners shall appear before the investigating officer in Crime No.1067 of 2023 of Konni Police Station as and when summoned to do so;
(iii) Petitioners shall not attempt to interfere with the investigation or to influence or intimidate any witness in Crime No.1067 of 2023 of Konni Police Station;
(iv) Petitioners shall not involve in any other crime while on bail.

